<title>CAMBODIA: SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT CAMBODIA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN BEAT CAMBODIA 4-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PHNOM PENH 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan beat Cambodia 4-1</p>
<p>in their World Cup Asian Zone Group 5 soccer qualifier on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>    Standings	P   W   D  L   F    A   PTS</p>
<p> Uzbekistan	  5   4   1  0   15   2   13</p>
<p> Yemen		 5   2   2  1    9   2    8</p>
<p> Indonesia	   6   1   4  1   11   6    7</p>
<p> Cambodia	    6   0   1  5    2  27    1</p>
<p>Final group match - July 13, Uzbekistan v Yemen in Tashkent.</p>
</text>
